## 数据格式

### Xiaoli Chat → Webhook 服务器

\`\`\`json
{
  "event": "message",
  "timestamp": 1712640000,
  "data": {
    "user": "user-id",
    "channel": "channel-id",
    "message": "消息内容"
  }
}
\`\`\`

### Webhook 服务器 → OpenClaw

\`\`\`json
{
  "senderId": "user-id",
  "chatId": "channel-id",
  "messageId": "msg-1712640000000000",
  "text": "消息内容",
  "isDirectMessage": true,
  "threadId": "可选"
}
\`\`\`

### OpenClaw → Webhook 服务器

\`\`\`json
{
  "chatId": "channel-id",
  "text": "AI 回复内容",
  "threadId": "可选"
}
\`\`\`

### Webhook 服务器 → OpenClaw (响应)

\`\`\`json
{
  "id": "message-id"
}
\`\`\`

